{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3193","id":3533571071,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887SngP_","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3193","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3193.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3193.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3193","number":3193,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"integration: stabilize docker harness for flaky transport and slow webservice build","user":{"login":"wangrzneu","id":3406517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDY1MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3406517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu","html_url":"https://github.com/wangrzneu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nTwo independent harness improvements that have been surfacing as flakes and slowdowns when running the full integration suite.\n\n- `integration/dockertestutil/network.go`: wrap `pool.NetworksByName`, `pool.CreateNetwork`, `pool.Client.ListContainers`, and `pool.Client.ConnectNetwork` with a small retry (`withDockerRetry`) that handles transient transport errors (`broken pipe`, `connection reset by peer`, `unexpected EOF`) before failing the test. Non-transient errors fail as before. Also treat empty container lookups as `ErrContainerNotFound` rather than panicking.\n- `integration/scenario.go`: stop rebuilding `Dockerfile.integration` each time `Webservice()` is invoked; run the static test web service on a prebuilt `python:3.13-alpine` image. The image is overridable via the `HEADSCALE_INTEGRATION_WEBSERVICE_IMAGE` env var (`repository:tag` format) if a user wants to pin to an internal mirror.\n\nNeither change alters test semantics — they only affect harness reliability and build time.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `go test ./integration/dockertestutil -count=1`\n- [x] `go run ./cmd/hi run TestSubnetRouterMultiNetwork` — exercises `Webservice()` end-to-end. Run id `20260415-174544-avbrwf`\n- [x] `go run ./cmd/hi run TestSubnetRouterMultiNetworkExitNode` — same run id\n- [x] `go run ./cmd/hi run TestGrantViaSubnetSteering` — run id `20260415-174509-rlpfy2`","created_at":"2026-04-15T11:29:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T11:30:42Z","closed_at":"2026-04-15T11:30:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"da4eebb11cbe5375a5f320b4734ad5ee2af0dba5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"publi